Z||000000||Goatman||07-29-2001||09:25 PM||||Can anyone tell me where to look for trouble spots of rust on my Fiero's frame. THanx <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/me.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Raydar||07-29-2001||11:17 PM||||My "favorite" place to check is on the inside of the trunk, on the sides, near the top. Pull back the carpet on both sides. Look where the frame rails are spot welded to the sides of the trunk. <BR>Battery trays like to rust out.<BR>Also check where the control arms pivot at the frame. Heard some horror stories about those.<BR>I'm sure others can add some more.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||AutoXer||07-30-2001||06:43 AM||||If it has a sunroof, pull back the weatherstripping around the snroof and check there.  This rusted pretty bad on my 85 GT winter driver.  Caused the sunroof to leak.||||reg||1
